---
---

<section class="py-12 md:py-20 bg-white border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    
    <div class="bg-slate-950 text-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl space-y-6 relative overflow-hidden">
      
      <!-- Real Web Development Laptop Code Background Wallpaper (High Visibility) -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('/images/bg-laptop-code.jpg')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-70 pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950/85 via-slate-900/80 to-slate-950/85 backdrop-blur-[1px] pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold bg-brand-gold/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40">
            Honestidad Directa
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
            Soporte local, con reglas claras
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
            Como cliente de Cuadrape, recibes un número de WhatsApp exclusivo para soporte directo en tu hospedaje.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-2">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/90 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/80 space-y-2 backdrop-blur-md shadow-md">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-gold font-bold text-sm">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
              <span>Horario Regular de Soporte</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              De <strong>Lunes a Sábado de 9:00 a 19:00</strong> para consultas operativas, dudas o configuración de nuevas tarifas.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-amber-950/80 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-amber-600/60 space-y-2 backdrop-blur-md shadow-md">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-400 font-bold text-sm">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
              <span>Urgencias de Cobro y Recepción</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-amber-200/95 leading-relaxed">
              Si un problema crítico impide registrar ingresos o cobrar en caja, te respondemos en <strong>menos de 2 horas, cualquier día y a cualquier hora.</strong>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 text-xs text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-800 italic">
          No prometemos atención 24 horas para todo. Prometemos responder de inmediato cuando de verdad importa para tu caja.
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
